<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/v2-head', { title: 'Terms and conditions' }) %>
  <% if (draft) { %><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><% } %>
</head>
<body class="v2 v2-focus-page">
  <%- include('partials/v2-focus-header', { backHref: '/' }) %>
  <main class="v2-terms">
    <h1 class="v2-focus-title">Terms and conditions</h1>
    <% if (draft) { %><p class="v2-alert"><strong>DRAFT</strong> · Pending legal review</p><% } %>

    <section>
      <h2>Free trial</h2>
      <p>New accounts get <%= trialDays %> days of membership access. You don’t need a card to start your trial. To keep using membership features after the trial, choose a paid membership.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Membership and renewal</h2>
      <p>New members pay <%= firstYear %> for the first year. Membership renews automatically at <%= renewal %> a year unless you cancel before the renewal date. Prices are in Australian dollars and include GST.</p>
      <p>You can cancel from Plan &amp; Usage. Cancel before your next renewal to avoid being charged for another year.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Referral rewards</h2>
      <p>For every <%= requiredPaid %> friends who sign up with your referral link and become paying members, you can earn a <%= firstYear %> renewal on your next yearly membership. Refunded memberships don’t count. Rewards are applied one at a time.</p>
      <p>When there’s a waitlist, a referral link can let up to <%= waitlistInvites %> people skip it. Rewards have no cash value and can’t be transferred. The offer can change or end.</p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/v2-focus-footer') %>
</body>
</html>
